<view class="page"><view class="intro"><text class="kicker">YOUR LITTLE SAVING HELPER</text><view>买之前，<text>查一下。</text></view><view class="subtitle">复制商品链接，让每一次下单更划算。</view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-title">↗ 链接查券工具 <text class="pill">自动识别平台</text></view><view class="label">商品链接或分享文案</view><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="2000" placeholder="粘贴淘宝、京东或拼多多商品链接…"/><view class="input-tools"><text>{{detected}}</text><button bindtap="paste">粘贴</button><button bindtap="clear">清空</button></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="convert" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查找优惠，预览转链 →</button><view class="examples"><text>试试示例</text><button data-platform="taobao" bindtap="example">淘宝</button><button data-platform="jd" bindtap="example">京东</button><button data-platform="pdd" bindtap="example">拼多多</button></view><view class="demo-note" wx:if="{{demo}}">交互演示 · 不生成真实推广链接。商品、价格与优惠均为样例。</view></view>
  <view class="card result" wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="result-label">{{result.mode==='demo'?'演示结果 · 未接入联盟':'查询结果'}}</view><block wx:if="{{result.product}}"><view class="product-row"><image src="{{result.product.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text class="platform-{{result.platform}}">{{result.platformName}} / 示例商品</text><view class="product-title">{{result.product.title}}</view><view class="price">¥{{result.product.priceLabel}}<text>券后</text></view><view class="coupon">券 ¥{{result.product.couponLabel}}</view></view></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" wx:if="{{result.mode==='demo'}}" bindtap="copyDemo">复制演示结果</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="purchase">{{result.mode==='live'?'领券去购买 ↗':'查看购买方式 ↗'}}</button></view></block><view wx:else class="unknown"><view>{{result.platformName}}链接已识别</view><text>尚未连接联盟 API，无法查询这件商品的优惠信息，也未生成推广链接。</text></view></view>
  <view class="history-heading">最近查过<button wx:if="{{history.length}}" bindtap="clearHistory">清空</button></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="history-empty">查过的示例好物，会在这里等你。</view><button class="history-row" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="previous"><image src="{{item.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view>{{item.title}}<text>{{item.platformName}} · 演示记录</text></view><text>↗</text></button><view class="footnote">记录仅保存在本设备上，不代表已产生订单。</view>
  <view class="how"><text class="kicker">HOW IT WORKS</text><view class="how-title">省钱，只需三步</view><view>① 复制商品分享链接</view><view>② 查询优惠并生成推广链接</view><view>③ 回原购物平台领券、下单</view><text>价格以结算页为准，付款与售后均在原平台进行。</text></view>
</view>
